  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s family asset mission is to collect five Liang of golden bee’s honey wine. Golden bees are fist-sized with gold and black stripes and a sharp stinger. Small hives hold only honey; only large or medium hives produce precious honey wine from a large accumulation of honey. Gathering it needs a defensive Gu to withstand the stings.",
      "chapters": [
        98
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "golden-bee-hives",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_defensive_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Using Jade Skin Gu, Fang Yuan endures the bees’ attacks and fills a bullskin water sack with golden honey wine.",
      "chapters": [
        100
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "gathered-stock",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_jade_skin_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Opening the sack releases a fragrance specific to honey wine, which proves the mission stock when he presents it at the internal affairs hall.",
      "chapters": [
        101
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "mission-hand-in",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan arrives at the internal affairs hall and turns in the golden honey wine.",
      "chapters": [
        102
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "mission-turn-in",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Leftover golden honey wine from the inheritance mission serves as the sweet wine among the four flavors needed to fuse a Four Flavors Liquor Worm.",
      "chapters": [
        111
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sweet-fusion-wine",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_four_flavors_liquor_worm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the fusion, sweet belongs to golden honey wine. After the redberry wine is spent, Fang Yuan pours golden honey wine into the jar; the white light ball swells again as the honey wine immerses it.",
      "chapters": [
        121
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "four-flavors-recipe",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
